4. Date / locale / multilingual patch

Your bilingual and multilingual docs are already strong.
Patch only clarifies storage vs display.

4.1 Date storage rule

All stored dates must use canonical machine format:

YYYY-MM-DD for plain dates
UTC/ISO for datetimes
4.2 Admin display rule

Admin UI may display dates in tenant-preferred format, including:

dd.mm.yyyy

But that is display formatting only.

4.3 Public display rule

Public display must follow selected language / market locale.

4.4 Language separation rule

Keep this strict separation:

code / schema / API = English
admin UI = Vietnamese-first, English optional
public content = localized content variants
do not duplicate tours by language; localize content instead
